    "## 8. Do the risk tiers mean what they say?\n",
    "\n",
    "The app sorts shipments into four tiers by predicted risk: Low (up to 30%), Medium (31 to 60%), High (61 to 80%) and Critical (above 80%). Each tier should contain clearly more failures than the one below it."
   ]
